{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"},{"scopes":["profile","relationships"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Answer Typeza test questions"},"description":"Send the person's answers for one batch of a Typeza test begun with start_test, using its draft_id and key. `answers` maps each question code to 1 (statement_1 fits better) or 2 (statement_2 fits better). Returns status next_questions with the next batch or, once every question is answered, the result: status type_found with the Typeza type (name, slug, page, short description) and keep_url, or status choose_type with candidate types when the answers fit more than one equally. Answers are saved with every call, so a test can continue later: send empty answers to get the current batch back. Give the person keep_url: it opens the full result on typeza.ai and lets them save it to an account. For a signed-in person, a first result becomes their Typeza type; a retake keeps the type they have.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"answers":{"additionalProperties":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Question code to 1 (statement_1 fits better) or 2 (statement_2 fits better). Send {} to get the current batch back.","title":"Answers","type":"object"},"draft_id":{"description":"The draft_id start_test returned.","title":"Draft Id","type":"string"},"key":{"description":"The key start_test returned, passed back unchanged.","title":"Key","type":"string"}},"required":["draft_id","key","answers"],"title":"answer_testArguments","type":"object"},"name":"answer_test","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"QuestionBatch":{"properties":{"answered":{"title":"Answered","type":"integer"},"batch":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/QuestionItem"},"title":"Batch","type":"array"},"draft_id":{"title":"Draft Id","type":"string"},"key":{"title":"Key","type":"string"},"language":{"title":"Language","type":"string"},"status":{"const":"next_questions","title":"Status","type":"string"},"total"